#. Definition of "Protected Item": This terminology is specific to Comet Backup. It is a set of files the user has chosen to be backed up.
msgid "You can resolve this issue by requesting the administrator to provide additional Protected Item types"
msgstr "Tento problém vyřešíte požádáním administrátora o další typy Chráněných položek"

#. Definition of "Protected Item": This terminology is specific to Comet Backup. It is a set of files the user has chosen to be backed up.
msgid "You can resolve this issue by requesting the administrator to provide at least one Protected Item type"
msgstr "Tento problém vyřešíte požádáním administrátora o alespoň jeden typ Chráněné položky"

#. Definition of "Storage Vault": This terminology is specific to Comet Backup. It is a place where data can be stored.
msgid "You can resolve this issue by requesting the administrator to provide at least one Storage Vault type"
msgstr "Tento problém vyřešíte požádáním administrátora o alespoň jeden typ Datového trezoru"

msgid "You can set a custom web brand for each tenant."
msgstr "Můžete nastavit vlastní webovou značku pro každého Tenanta."

msgid "You can use this bucket from the client software via the following details:"
msgstr "Tento Bucket můžete použít z klientského softwaru pomocí následujících údajů:"

#, qt-format
msgid "You have selected a %1 backup snapshot for restore."
msgstr "Vybrali jste bod obnovy %1 k obnově."

#, c-format
msgid "You have selected a %s backup snapshot for restore."
msgstr "Vybrali jste bod obnovy %s k obnově."

#, c-format
msgid "You have set the Object Lock retention period to %d days."
msgstr "Nastavili jste dobu uchování Zámku objektů na %d dní."

msgid "You may need to reconfigure your Storage Gateway access key and secret key to use the root keys."
msgstr "Možná budete muset překonfigurovat klíče Storage Gateway."

msgid "You must choose a group or team account to view its members"
msgstr "Pro zobrazení členů musíte vybrat skupinu nebo tým"

msgid "You must choose one account to view its members"
msgstr "Pro zobrazení členů musíte vybrat jeden účet"

msgid "You must select at least one item for editing"
msgstr "Musíte vybrat alespoň jednu položku k úpravě"

msgid "You need to choose a storage location first."
msgstr "Nejprve musíte vybrat umístění úložiště."

msgid "You need to choose accounts with the same type for bulk editing"
msgstr "Pro hromadnou úpravu musíte vybrat účty stejného typu"

#. Definition of "TOTP": This is a well-known industry term. There might be a well-known translation, or, it might be common to use the English term. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-time_Password_algorithm
msgid "You only can disable TOTP here, not enable it."
msgstr "Zde můžete TOTP pouze zakázat, ne povolit."

#. Definition of "WebAuthn": This is a standard for two-factor authentication. This is a well-known industry term. There might be a well-known translation, or, it might be common to use the English term. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WebAuthn
msgid "You only can disable WebAuthn here, not enable it."
msgstr "Zde můžete WebAuthn pouze zakázat, ne povolit."

msgid "You only can view members of one group account at a time"
msgstr "Najednou můžete zobrazit členy pouze jedné skupiny"

#, c-format
msgid "Your job should now be visible. It may be necessary to use the refresh button (%s) in the navigation bar to fetch the latest results."
msgstr "Úloha by měla být viditelná. Použijte tlačítko obnovit (%s)."

#. Definition of "Protected Item": This terminology is specific to Comet Backup. It is a set of files the user has chosen to be backed up.
msgid "Your previous policy includes Default Protected Items."
msgstr "Vaše předchozí pravidla obsahují výchozí Chráněné položky."

#. Definition of "Storage Vault": This terminology is specific to Comet Backup. It is a place where data can be stored.
#, c-format
msgid "Your Storage Vault was unable to provide %.1f%% of all data in the vault (%d/%d files)."
msgstr "Datový trezor neposkytl %.1f%% všech dat (%d/%d souborů)."

#. Definition of "Storage Vault": This terminology is specific to Comet Backup. It is a place where data can be stored.
msgid "Your Storage Vault was unable to provide all data in the vault."
msgstr "Datový trezor neposkytl všechna data."

#, c-format
msgid "Your system is configured to backup to %s. You're good to go!"
msgstr "Systém je nakonfigurován pro zálohování do %s. Vše je připraveno!"

msgid "Zero-filled byte range"
msgstr "Rozsah bajtů vyplněný nulami"

#, qt-format
msgid "[%1] Item %2 (%3) of %4 (%5)"
msgstr "[%1] Položka %2 (%3) z %4 (%5)"
